{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Mnp1sHzayePjTtC1QvxopW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Project State Summary\n\n**Problem**: go-unix-utils stress-tests a specification-driven code generation pipeline (mage-claude-orchestrator) by regenerating GNU coreutils/moreutils in Go. Specifications are derived from C source; Go implementations are verified via differential testing against Homebrew reference binaries.\n\n**Architecture**: Four-stage pipeline (extract → specify → synthesize → verify). Core components: cmd/ (one package per utility), pkg/testutils (differential testing harness), pkg/sys (syscall abstractions), pkg/format (output formatting), pkg/hashutil, pkg/sizeparse, pkg/encutil. magefiles/ drives the orchestrator. Specifications live in docs/specs/.\n\n**Current state**: 114 SRDs specified, many utilities implemented across releases 00.0–07.1. The current generation run (run 44, branch `generation-run44`) is actively working through requirements. Recent commits completed srd067-split R2.1–R3.4.\n\n**Current release focus**: Release 08.1 is the earliest release with actionable (\"ready\") requirements. srd067-split has R4.1–R4.4 remaining; srd068-csplit through srd073-printf are fully ready (16 requirements each).\n\n## Priority Analysis\n\n1. **Complete srd067-split** — R4.1–R4.4 are the final group. R1–R3 were just completed (tasks 5445, 5446). Finishing split closes out this utility.\n2. **Start srd068-csplit** — Next utility in release 08.1 alphabetically. All 16 requirements ready. First task creates the package; subsequent tasks extend it.\n\n## Weight Budget Verification\n\nAll requirements assumed weight=1 (default per requirements.yaml):\n\n- Task 0: srd067 R4.1(w=1) + R4.2(w=1) + R4.3(w=1) + R4.4(w=1) = 4 ✓\n- Task 1: srd068 R1.1(w=1) + R1.2(w=1) + R1.3(w=1) + R1.4(w=1) = 4 ✓\n- Task 2: srd068 R2.1(w=1) + R2.2(w=1) + R2.3(w=1) + R2.4(w=1) = 4 ✓\n- Task 3: srd068 R3.1(w=1) + R3.2(w=1) + R3.3(w=1) + R3.4(w=1) = 4 ✓\n\n```yaml\n- index: 0\n  title: \"[stitch] cmd/split: srd067 R4.1-R4.4\"\n  dependency: -1\n  description: |\n    deliverable_type: code\n\n    required_reading:\n      - docs/specs/software-requirements/srd067-split.yaml (R4.1-R4.4 requirements and acceptance criteria)\n      - cmd/split/main.go (existing implementation covering R1-R3)\n      - cmd/split/split_test.go (existing differential tests from R1-R3)\n\n    files:\n      - path: cmd/split/main.go\n        action: modify\n        note: Add R4.1-R4.4 functionality to existing split implementation\n      - path: cmd/split/split_test.go\n        action: modify\n        note: Add differential test cases for R4.1-R4.4\n\n    requirements:\n      - id: R1\n        text: Implement srd067 R4.1 per the SRD specification\n      - id: R2\n        text: Implement srd067 R4.2 per the SRD specification\n      - id: R3\n        text: Implement srd067 R4.3 per the SRD specification\n      - id: R4\n        text: Implement srd067 R4.4 per the SRD specification\n\n    design_decisions:\n      - id: D1\n        text: Extend the existing split implementation -- do not restructure code from R1-R3\n      - id: D2\n        text: Add differential test cases using the existing RunDiffTests harness and gsplit reference binary\n\n    acceptance_criteria:\n      - id: AC1\n        text: go build -o bin/split ./cmd/split/ succeeds with no errors\n      - id: AC2\n        text: go vet ./cmd/split/... reports no issues\n      - id: AC3\n        text: go test ./cmd/split/... -count=1 passes (skips if gsplit not in PATH)\n      - id: AC4\n        text: All srd067 R4.1-R4.4 acceptance criteria from the SRD are satisfied\n\n- index: 1\n  title: \"[stitch] cmd/csplit: srd068 R1.1-R1.4\"\n  dependency: -1\n  description: |\n    deliverable_type: code\n\n    required_reading:\n      - docs/specs/software-requirements/srd068-csplit.yaml (R1.1-R1.4 requirements and acceptance criteria)\n      - pkg/testut